  "articleBody": "Renovating an older home in San Diego County starts with investigating the existing structure, confirming permit and historic-review requirements, and defining which systems need improvement. A coordinated design-build plan can then align layout, materials, structural work, plumbing, electrical upgrades, construction phasing, and final inspections before demolition begins.",
